      "id": "https://newatlas.com/energy/drive2x-evs-parked-airports-energy-grid/",
      "url": "https://newatlas.com/energy/drive2x-evs-parked-airports-energy-grid/",
      "title": "[New Atlas] V2G system sucks energy out of parked EVs to supply the grid",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e7ac395/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5979x3139+0+438/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1f%2F31%2F2d4ed05644e49f491767f8252d99%2Fdepositphotos-657451018-xl.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🌲 🏔️ 🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas.com%2Fenergy%2Fdrive2x-evs-parked-airports-energy-grid%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Instead of just sitting idle, electric vehicles parked at airports or left overnight at hotels could feed the municipal grid from their battery packs, then charge up before they're needed\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0455129/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5979x4014+0+0/resize/1430x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1f%2F31%2F2d4ed05644e49f491767f8252d99%2Fdepositphotos-657451018-xl.jpg\"/><p>Electric vehicles already solve a lot of problems: they reduce our dependence on gas and help reduce emissions. At the same time, EVs are a major source of electricity consumption, and most existing electricity grids were simply not designed for this level of demand. That creates new challenges, but what if EVs could also become part of the solution to this same problem?</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/energy/drive2x-evs-parked-airports-energy-grid/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/energy/\">Energy</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/engineering/\">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/battery-electric-vehicles/\" rel=\"tag\">Battery Electric Vehicles</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/ev-charging/\" rel=\"tag\">EV Charging</a></p></p>",
      "date_published": "2026-10-04T22:00:00+00:00",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "New Atlas",
          "url": "https://newatlas.com"
        }
      ],
      "image": "https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e7ac395/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5979x3139+0+438/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1f%2F31%2F2d4ed05644e49f491767f8252d99%2Fdepositphotos-657451018-xl.jpg&na.image_optimisation=0",
      "_score": 57,
      "_quality": 68,
      "_relevance": 72,
      "_local_score": 0,
      "_content_type": "analysis"
    },
