      "id": "https://newatlas.com/automotive/tu-ecomotive-ev-cleans-tire-brake-dust-ventra/",
      "url": "https://newatlas.com/automotive/tu-ecomotive-ev-cleans-tire-brake-dust-ventra/",
      "title": "[New Atlas] Visionary coupe self-cleans the emissions EVs still create",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/77c2b61/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1956x1027+0+139/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb7%2F62%2F9e8c58a3490bbc527bf1edde09ba%2Fcsm-ventra-7-by-sarp-gurel-1-b4b70be388.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p><img alt=\"The car captures particles at the wheels, where the dust is born\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1d21dfd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1956x1304+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb7%2F62%2F9e8c58a3490bbc527bf1edde09ba%2Fcsm-ventra-7-by-sarp-gurel-1-b4b70be388.jpg\"/><p>Electric cars don't cough out exhaust, but their tires and brakes are still shedding a nearly invisible haze into the air. A team of Dutch students has built a concept that gives those particles a static charge, then sticks them to a grounded surface, like a balloon grabbing lint.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/automotive/tu-ecomotive-ev-cleans-tire-brake-dust-ventra/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/automotive/\">Automotive</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/transport/\">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/technical-university-of-eindhoven/\" rel=\"tag\">Technical University of Eindhoven</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/eco-friendly/\" rel=\"tag\">Eco-Friendly</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/automotive-designers/\" rel=\"tag\">automotive designers</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/electric+vehicle/\" rel=\"tag\">Electric Vehicles</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/microplastic/\" rel=\"tag\">Microplastic</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/pollution/\" rel=\"tag\">Pollution</a></p></p>",
